{
  "cues": [
    {
      "fragment": "f1",
      "scene": "hook",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 3.68,
      "lines": [
        "Amazon's experimental hiring tool",
        "allegedly ranked women lower."
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f1",
      "scene": "problem",
      "start": 4,
      "end": 9.41,
      "lines": [
        "In 2026, the challenge is to govern AI",
        "responsibly and still create real value."
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f1",
      "scene": "canvas",
      "start": 10,
      "end": 12.74,
      "lines": [
        "In AI Center X,",
        "you start with the AI Canvas:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f1",
      "scene": "canvas",
      "start": 12.74,
      "end": 17.245,
      "lines": [
        "the CV Screening Assistant's problem,",
        "its data, and the people it affects."
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f1",
      "scene": "canvas",
      "start": 17.245,
      "end": 18.95,
      "lines": [
        "Then you simulate the risks."
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f2",
      "scene": "risks",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 2.49,
      "lines": [
        "An AI agent suggests risks, each cited"
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f2",
      "scene": "risks",
      "start": 2.49,
      "end": 6.487,
      "lines": [
        "from the MIT AI Risk Repository",
        "and the AI Incident Database."
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f2",
      "scene": "risks",
      "start": 6.487,
      "end": 9.304,
      "lines": [
        "You select the relevant",
        "ones and save them."
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f2",
      "scene": "risks",
      "start": 9.304,
      "end": 11.27,
      "lines": [
        "Now, generate the mitigations."
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f3",
      "scene": "mitigations",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 3.556,
      "lines": [
        "For every saved risk,",
        "the agent proposes mitigations,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f3",
      "scene": "mitigations",
      "start": 3.556,
      "end": 7.784,
      "lines": [
        "each classed by MIT's draft",
        "taxonomy and tied to the EU AI Act."
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f3",
      "scene": "mitigations",
      "start": 7.784,
      "end": 9.596,
      "lines": [
        "Again, you select and save."
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f3",
      "scene": "mitigations",
      "start": 9.596,
      "end": 11.81,
      "lines": [
        "Next come the model enhancements."
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f4",
      "scene": "enhancements",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 2.862,
      "lines": [
        "Finally, the agent shows",
        "how to put those mitigations"
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f4",
      "scene": "enhancements",
      "start": 2.862,
      "end": 5.4,
      "lines": [
